{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26710","headline":"赠张籍太祝 · 姚合","name":"赠张籍太祝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝妙江南曲，凄凉怨女诗。\n古风无手敌，新语是人知。\n飞动应由格，功夫过却奇。\n麟台添集卷，乐府换歌词。\n李白应先拜，刘祯必自疑。\n贫须君子救，病合国家医。\n野客开山借，邻僧与米炊。\n甘贫辞聘币，依选受官资。\n多见愁连晓，稀闻债尽时。\n圣朝文物盛，太祝独低眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}